# GludioBowGuardStand (35012), a standing archer of the Aden siege (clan aden_siege_clan, 300): a hit
# of 22, a twentieth of its fixture hit points, wants the character attacked, holding its ground,
# 100 for its attacked hook and 50 for its clan-attacked one (the call reaches the archer itself).
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioStand.GludioBowGuardStand
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioStand.GludioStand
npc bow 35012 SiegeGuard 150 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300

hit bow 22
  desires bow attack(player,hold)=150
